  "identifier": "ggsegverse",
  "description": "Installs and loads the core packages of the 'ggsegverse', an ecosystem for plotting brain atlases and mapping data onto brain regions in 2D and 3D, together with 'ggplot2', in a single call. Also provides helpers to find and install atlas packages, report package versions, and detect namespace conflicts. Learn more about the 'ggsegverse' ecosystem at <https://ggsegverse.github.io/ggseg/>.",
